# Jötun Grunt: "Cumulative upkeep--Put two cards from a single graveyard on the bottom of their owner's library." Bot1's graveyard
# holds one card (Black Lotus, which paid for the Grunt) and Bot2's one (a Lotus Petal): two cards in all, but not in a single
# graveyard, so at Bot1's turn 3 upkeep the cost can't be paid, Bot1 is not asked, and the Grunt is sacrificed.

[Bot1 Deck]
Jötun Grunt
Black Lotus
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Lotus Petal
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: White)
Bot1.Hand.Jötun Grunt.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Lotus Petal.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Battlefield.Lotus Petal.Activate(Color: Blue)
[T3 Bot1.Upkeep]
? Stack.Count = 1
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
! Bot1.Accept
[T3 Bot1.Main1]

[Expect]
Bot1.Graveyard = Jötun Grunt; Black Lotus
Bot2.Graveyard = Lotus Petal
